# Autogenerated VS/MD/Consulo solution and project files
ExportedObj/
.consulo/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.log

.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

**/obj/*
**/bin/*
**/.idea/*
# Headless build (Headless~/, see CLAUDE.md). The project files are tracked
# despite the *.csproj rule above; build output and the FixPointCS checkout are not.
!Headless~/**/*.csproj
!Tools~/**/*.csproj
Headless~/bin/
Headless~/obj/
Headless~/out/
Headless~/external/
